<title>UK: Railtrack publishes network outlook Feb 20.</title>
<headline>Railtrack publishes network outlook Feb 20.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK rail operator Railtrack Plc said on Friday it would publish its 1996/97 Network Management Statement on February 20.</p>
<p>The statement, published annually, would set out Railtrack's plans for the maintenance, renewal and enhancement of the network together with projections for future network capacity requirements.</p>
<p>Railtrack was privatised last year in a 1.93 billion stg float.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
